        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Marktopia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fast-paced world of supermarket management!<br>Take control of a fully operational store — keep shelves stocked, set smart prices, and serve an ever-growing stream of customers. Every decision directly affects your profits and your shoppers’ satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market Tycoon</strong> brings a fresh take on classic market sims with its focus on smart planning, fast reactions, and smooth inventory control — no complicated systems, just pure management fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 <strong>Inventory &amp; Pricing Control</strong><br>Order products, place them on shelves, and set the right prices. Don’t let your shelves stay empty — every missed sale counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😊 <strong>Real-Time Customer Feedback</strong><br>Track customer satisfaction by watching their facial expressions. Smiles mean success, frowns mean something’s wrong — fix issues before they grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧼 <strong>Cleanliness Matters</strong><br>Deploy your cleaners to keep your store spotless. Messy floors and dirty aisles will hurt your reputation and drive customers away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍‍♂️ <strong>Cashier Management</strong><br>Manage your cashiers effectively. Fast service reduces long lines and keeps your customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Rising Challenge, Growing Crowd</strong><br>As your store gains popularity, more customers will arrive — and so will the pressure. Can you keep everything running under control?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Marktopia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fast-paced world of supermarket management!<br>Take control of a fully operational store — keep shelves stocked, set smart prices, and serve an ever-growing stream of customers. Every decision directly affects your profits and your shoppers’ satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market Tycoon</strong> brings a fresh take on classic market sims with its focus on smart planning, fast reactions, and smooth inventory control — no complicated systems, just pure management fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 <strong>Inventory &amp; Pricing Control</strong><br>Order products, place them on shelves, and set the right prices. Don’t let your shelves stay empty — every missed sale counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😊 <strong>Real-Time Customer Feedback</strong><br>Track customer satisfaction by watching their facial expressions. Smiles mean success, frowns mean something’s wrong — fix issues before they grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧼 <strong>Cleanliness Matters</strong><br>Deploy your cleaners to keep your store spotless. Messy floors and dirty aisles will hurt your reputation and drive customers away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍‍♂️ <strong>Cashier Management</strong><br>Manage your cashiers effectively. Fast service reduces long lines and keeps your customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Rising Challenge, Growing Crowd</strong><br>As your store gains popularity, more customers will arrive — and so will the pressure. Can you keep everything running under control?</p>",
